manchu wrote:
> How in Gehennom

;-)

> does one ascend without food? 

Pray for food (unless you're going atheist, too - that makes it much
harder), don't do anything that consumes food unless necessary, quaff
from fountains, quaff fruit juice (and water?), put on a ring of slow
digestion ASAP, use an amulet of life saving to restore you, when you
die from lack of food etc.
Unless you're going atheist you most likely will only need the ring and
some prayers (horn of plenty to get juice and water is probably nice to
have, too)


> (much less as a spell caster...)

Wizards don't get hungry from spellcasting when they're INT is 18 or
better and they do have the chance to start with a ring of slow
digestion, so they're actually one of the easiest classes to go foodless
with if you just have enough luck with your starting stats and
equipment.


